 ## Unreleased
 
+- The late check-out fee is 40.00 by default (`late_checkout_fee`).
 - The night audit removes cancelled reservations older than `cancelled_retention_days` (default 30).
 - Occupancy is a percentage in `day_statistics()` and `report occupancy --format json`.
 - Checking in to a room that is not ready names its housekeeping status.
